.* A data panel: dot-leader entries, a group, an extender, a selection field.
:PNLGRP DFTMSGF=QGPL/MYMSGF SCHIDX=QGPL/MYSCHIDX.
:COPYR.Copyright (C) 2026 Quartz Systems
:CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10' CASE=UPPER.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=LIBCL BASETYPE=OBJNAME.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=QTYCL BASETYPE='PACKED 7 0' WIDTH=9.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=YNCL BASETYPE='CHAR 1'.
:TL MSG=MSG0001.
:TI VALUE='Y'.*YES
:TI VALUE='N'.*NO
:ETL.
:CHECK TYPE=NOTBLANK MSG=MSG0002.
:ECLASS.
:CLASS NAME=TEXTCL BASETYPE='CHAR 50'.
:ECLASS.
:VAR NAME=CUSTNAME CLASS=NAMECL.
:VAR NAME=CUSTLIB CLASS=LIBCL VALUE='*LIBL'.
:VAR NAME=QTY CLASS=QTYCL.
:VAR NAME=ACTIVE CLASS=YNCL VALUE='Y'.
:VAR NAME=PRIORITY CLASS=YNCL.
:VAR NAME=NOTE CLASS=TEXTCL.
:VAR NAME=PNLID CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='CUST01'.
:VARRCD NAME=CUSTREC VARS='CUSTNAME CUSTLIB QTY ACTIVE NOTE' NOPUT='NOTE'.
:COND NAME=ISACTIVE EXPR='&ACTIVE. EQ "Y"'.
:COND NAME=BIGQTY EXPR='&QTY. GT 100 AND NOT &ACTIVE. EQ "N"'.
:KEYL NAME=DATAKEYS HELP=HLPKEYS.
:KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
:KEYI KEY=F1 ACTION=HELP.
:KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT HELP=HLPF3.F3=Exit
:KEYI KEY=F5 ACTION='RETURN 5' VARUPD=YES COND=ISACTIVE.F5=Refresh
:KEYI KEY=F12 ACTION=CANCEL.F12=Cancel
:KEYI KEY=PAGEUP ACTION=PAGEUP.
:KEYI KEY=PAGEDOWN ACTION=PAGEDOWN.
:KEYI KEY=HELP ACTION=HELP.
:EKEYL.
:PANEL NAME=CUSTDTA HELP=HLPMAIN KEYL=DATAKEYS ENTER='RETURN 1'
       PANELID=PNLID TOPSEP=SPACE BOTSEP=RULE CSRVAR=CUSTNAME.Work with Customer
:TOPINST.Type choices, press Enter.
:DATA DEPTH=12 LAYOUT=1 BOTSEP=SPACE.Customer details
:DATACOL WIDTH=30.
:DATAI VAR=CUSTNAME USAGE=INOUT HELP=HLPNAME REQUIRED CSRLOC.Customer name
:DATAI VAR=CUSTLIB USAGE=INPUT HELP=HLPLIB.Library
:DATAIX VAR=QTY USAGE=INPUT.
:DATAIXT.Quantity
:DATAC HELP=HLPNAME.Name, *LIBL, *CURLIB
:DATAGRP GRPSEP=RULE HELP=HLPGRP COMPACT.Options
:DATAI VAR=ACTIVE USAGE=INPUT DISPLAY=YES.Active
:DATAI VAR=QTY USAGE=OUTPUT AUTOSKIP.Quantity on hand
:DATAI VAR=NOTE USAGE=INPUT MAXWIDTH=40 SHIFT=ALPHA.Note
:EDATAGRP.
:DATASLT VAR=PRIORITY USAGE=INPUT HELP=HLPPRI SLTTYPE=SINGLE.Priority
:DATASLTC VALUE='Y' HELP=HLPPRI.High
:DATASLTC VALUE='N' COND=ISACTIVE.Normal
:EDATASLT.
:EDATA.
:BOTINST.Current library is &CUSTLIB..
:EPANEL.
:HELP NAME=HLPMAIN.Work with Customer - Help
:P.This panel shows one customer. Type over a field and press
:PK.Enter:EPK. to save it.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPKEYS.Function keys - Help
:P.The keys of this panel.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPF3.F3=Exit - Help
:P.Leaves the panel without saving.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPNAME.Customer name - Help
:P.Up to ten characters. The name of the customer, &CUSTNAME., is
also shown in the title.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPLIB.Library - Help
:P.A library name, &splat.LIBL or &splat.CURLIB.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPGRP.Options - Help
:P.The customer's options.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=HLPPRI.Priority - Help
:P.High or normal.
:EHELP.
:EPNLGRP.
